  ('d6fe8e8f-749f-462d-88b3-b22dfdc11a4c', 'application_deadline', 'REA due November 1 (testing by November 30); Regular Decision due January 4 (testing by December 31)', 'Restrictive Early Action (REA) applications are due November 1, with all required and supplemental materials due by November 6, and standardized testing must be completed before November 30. Regular Decision (RD) applications are due January 4, with materials due January 10, and testing completed before December 31. NO YEAR STATED on the source page.', true, 'high', 'https://www.admissions.caltech.edu/apply/first-year-applicants/deadlines', '2026-09-03'::timestamptz, 'verified_current', 'fresh');
